 ploads/event/Precinct%2048.1%20Monthly%20Meeting%20sep26_20260828161405472
 148.png
DESCRIPTION:Please join us as we approach the home stretch in our efforts 
 to elect Democrats to represent North Carolina! Who should attend: All int
 erested Democrats and left-leaning unaffiliated voters. We are fast approa
 ching the midterm elections\, and need your support! Please come and hear 
 what our plans are leading up to the election.
LOCATION:The Vistas at Westfield Clubhouse\, 61 Westfield Way\, Candler\, 
 NC\, 28715
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/buncombedems/event/1020447/
X-SOURCE:Buncombe County Democratic Party
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:2026 Bond Issues on Our Ballots
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260908T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260908T170000
UID:0c43fecc677929575913c0cc1177aa7b@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Bond%20Issues_20260831140210560252.png
DESCRIPTION:Join our commissioner\, Terri Wells\, for a presentation on th
 e Open Space and Affordable Housing bonds that will be on your ballots thi
 s November. Terri will share an overview of the 2026 bonds and update us o
 n the impacts of the 2022 bonds. There will be plenty of time for your bon
 d questions. Who should attend: Buncombe County residents that would like 
 to be informed on these issues before voting. Everyone welcome!
LOCATION:Pisgah Valley Clubhouse\, 6 Rhododendron Way\, Candler\, NC\, 287
 15
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/buncombedems/event/1021969/
X-SOURCE:Buncombe County Democratic Party
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:2026 Hominies Cluster Annual Potluck Picnic
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260913T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260913T133000
UID:cfbbd1ee85da27d586d088dfd1d7b5bc@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Potluck%20Picnic%20-%20Mobilize_20260728023528189886.png
DESCRIPTION:Mark your calendar! The Hominies Cluster Annual Potluck Picnic
  is Sunday\, September 13\, from 2:00 – 4:30 PM at the Buncombe County S
 ports Park. Join us for friendship\, food and drink as we hear from our 20
 26 Democratic candidates and party leaders. The fun will start at 2:00 PM.
  If you can\, please bring your favorite potluck side dish to share. Meat 
 and drinks will be supplied. Who should attend: All Democrats and like-min
 ded unaffiliated voters in the Hominies Cluster (Precincts 24.1\, 44.1\, 4
 5.
LOCATION:Buncombe County Sports Park\, 58 Apac Dr\, Asheville\, NC\, 28806
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/buncombedems/event/955881/
X-SOURCE:Buncombe County Democratic Party
END:VEVENT
